    <!-- Biography -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-gray-bg">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <SectionHeader title="Biography" titleZh="個人簡介" />

            <div
                class="bg-white rounded-xl p-8 shadow-sm text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-700 space-y-2 text-justify"
            >
                <p data-lang-en>
                    <span class="font-bold text-navy">Sin-Ye Jhong</span> received
                    the Ph.D. degree in Engineering Science from National Cheng Kung
                    University (NCKU), Tainan, Taiwan, in <span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2024</span
                    >. From <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2023</span
                    > to <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2024</span>,
                    he was a Research Fellow with the Smart Electric Vehicle
                    (SEV) Research Center, National Taiwan University of Science and Technology
                    (NTUST), Taipei, Taiwan. In <span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2024</span
                    >, he was also a Visiting Scholar with the University of
                    South Florida (USF), Tampa, FL, USA, supported by the <span
                        class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >Graduate Students Study Abroad Fellowship (千里馬計畫)</span
                    > from the National Science and Technology Council (國科會). He
                    previously served as an Assistant Professor with the Department
                    of Artificial Intelligence at Tamkang University in <span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    >. Currently, he is an Assistant Professor with the Graduate
                    Institute of Intelligent Manufacturing Technology at NTUST.
                    His research interests include computer vision, deep
                    learning, multimodal learning, artificial intelligence of
                    things (AIoT), robot perception & navigation, and
                    human-robot interaction.
                </p>
                <p data-lang-zh>
                    <span class="font-bold text-navy">Sin-Ye Jhong</span> 於 <span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2024</span
                    > 年取得國立成功大學（NCKU）工程科學博士學位。<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2023</span
                    >–<span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2024</span> 年間於國立臺灣科技大學（NTUST）智慧電動車研究中心擔任研究員；<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2024</span
                    > 年並在國科會<span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold">千里馬計畫</span
                    >支持下，赴南佛羅里達大學（USF）擔任訪問學者。先前於 <span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    > 年於淡江大學人工智慧學系擔任助理教授，現為國立臺灣科技大學智慧製造科技研究所助理教授。研究興趣涵蓋
                    computer vision、deep learning、multimodal learning、artificial
                    intelligence of things (AIoT)、robot perception & navigation
                    與 human-robot interaction。
                </p>
                <p class="indent-8" data-lang-en>
                    Dr. Jhong's research excellence has been widely recognized.
                    In <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span>, he
                    was the recipient of <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >four prestigious Best Ph.D. Thesis Awards</span
                    >, conferred by the IEEE Tainan Section, the IET Taipei
                    Local Network, the Taiwan Association of Systems Science and
                    Engineering (中華民國系統學會), and the Taiwan Consumer
                    Electronics Society (中華民國消費電子學會). He has
                    established a prolific publication record with <span
                        class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold">over 15 papers</span
                    > in top-tier SCI journals, including <span class="italic"
                        >IEEE Trans. Consumer Electronics</span
                    >, <span class="italic"
                        >IEEE Trans. Instrumentation and Measurement</span
                    >, and <span class="italic"
                        >ACM Trans. Multimedia Computing, Communications, and
                        Applications</span
                    >. His co-authored paper in <span class="italic"
                        >IEEE MultiMedia</span
                    > was selected by the IEEE Computer Society Publications
                    Board as the Winner of the journal's <span
                        class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >2025 Best Paper Award</span
                    > — the sole winning paper of the entire year. In addition
                    to journal publications, Dr. Jhong has received numerous
                    accolades at international conferences.
                    His recent achievements in <span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    > include the <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >Outstanding Presentation Award</span
                    > at IEEE AVSS, the <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >First Prize Best Student Paper</span
                    > and <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >Second Prize Best Paper</span
                    > at Automation, the <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >Second Prize Best Paper</span
                    > at CACS, and the <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >Best Paper Honorable Mention</span
                    > at ARIS.
                </p>
                <p class="indent-8" data-lang-zh>
                    Dr. Jhong 曾獲多項研究獎項。<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    > 年榮獲 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >四項最佳博士論文獎</span
                    >，分別由 IEEE Tainan Section、IET Taipei Local Network、中華民國系統學會（TASSE）與中華民國消費電子學會（TCES）頒授。已於
                    SCI 期刊發表 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >逾 15 篇論文</span
                    >，包括 <span class="italic">IEEE Trans. Consumer Electronics</span
                    >、<span class="italic"
                        >IEEE Trans. Instrumentation and Measurement</span
                    > 與 <span class="italic"
                        >ACM Trans. Multimedia Computing, Communications, and
                        Applications</span
                    >；發表於 <span class="italic">IEEE MultiMedia</span
                    > 之合著論文更獲 IEEE Computer Society Publications Board
                    評選為該刊 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >2025 年度最佳論文獎（Winner）</span
                    >，為全年唯一獲獎論文；並於多個國際會議獲獎，<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    > 年成果包括 IEEE AVSS 的 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >傑出報告獎</span
                    >、Automation 的 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >最佳學生論文獎第一名</span
                    > 與 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >最佳論文獎第二名</span
                    >、CACS 的 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >最佳論文獎第二名</span
                    >，以及 ARIS 的 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >最佳論文獎佳作</span
                    >。
                </p>
                <p class="indent-8" data-lang-en>
                    Dedicated to bridging the gap between theoretical research
                    and practical application, Dr. Jhong has guided his research
                    team to win <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >over 30 awards</span
                    > in major national competitions. These include <span
                        class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold">top prizes</span
                    > in the NCHU Capstone Competition for AI Empowerment and Robotics
                    Applications in Manufacturing (<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    >), the International ICT Innovative Services Awards (<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    >), the National Electronic Design Creative Competition (<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2018</span
                    >–<span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2026</span>),
                    and the Intel® DevCup x OpenVINO™ Toolkit Competition (<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2021</span
                    >, <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2022</span>).
                    He has participated in <span
                        class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >over 20 industry-academic and NSTC projects</span
                    >, holding <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >2 U.S. patents</span
                    >, <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >10 Taiwan patents</span
                    >, and <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >1 China patent</span
                    >. He is also an active member of the academic community,
                    having served as a Session Chair for conferences such as
                    ARIS, CACS, Automation, and ICCE-TW, and as the Public
                    Announcement Chair at ICETA 2021, where he was honored
                    with the <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >Best Service Award</span
                    >.
                </p>
                <p class="indent-8" data-lang-zh>
                    Dr. Jhong 致力於銜接理論研究與實務應用，指導研究團隊在重要全國性競賽中獲得 <span
                        class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold">逾 30 項獎項</span
                    >，包括 NCHU Capstone Competition for AI Empowerment
                    and Robotics Applications in Manufacturing（<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    >）、International ICT Innovative Services Awards（<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2025</span
                    >）、National Electronic Design Creative Competition（<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2018</span
                    >–<span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2026</span>）與
                    Intel® DevCup x OpenVINO™ Toolkit Competition（<span
                        class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2021</span
                    >、<span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold">2022</span>）等競賽的 <span
                        class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold">首獎</span
                    >。參與 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >逾 20 項產學與國科會計畫</span
                    >，持有 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >2 項美國專利</span
                    >、<span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold">10 項臺灣專利</span
                    > 與 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold">1 項中國專利</span
                    >。亦活躍於學術社群，曾於 ARIS、CACS、Automation、ICCE-TW 等會議擔任議程主持人，並於
                    ICETA 2021 擔任公開宣傳主持人，榮獲 <span class="text-[#d83d70] font-bold"
                        >最佳服務獎</span
                    >。
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Education -->
    <section class="section-padding bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <SectionHeader title="Education" titleZh="學歷" />

            <div class="space-y-6">
                <TimelineCard
                    title="Ph.D. in Engineering Science"
                    titleZh="工程科學博士"
                    organization="National Cheng Kung University (NCKU)"
                    organizationZh="國立成功大學 (NCKU)"
                    organizationUrl="https://www.es.ncku.edu.tw/esncku/zh/"
                    period="2019 - 2024"
                    location="Tainan, Taiwan"
                    locationZh="台灣台南"
                    iconType="phd"
                    category="education"
                    watermarkLogo="/images/Logo/NCKU.png"
